      "writtenOn": "2025-07-31T21:31:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e NALLOC_FREQ\u003d0 and a default of 0\n\nBut then, oss-fuzz will not run with allocations failures\n\nDo you see a way to achieve that ?",
      "parentUuid": "67fd0e36_70ddaf29",
      "revId": "8ff771147d21fe68d10b9524022073c67f6eec1a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
